<?xml version='1.0' encoding='UTF-8'?>
<workout_file>
  <author>Gravel God Training</author>
  <name>Gravel Race Simulation</name>
  <description>FUEL:
Normal meal ~2h before. One bottle, 40-50g carbs. Done.

WARM-UP:
-2min building from Z1 to Z2

MAIN SET:
- 3 x (3min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3) + 1min @ 108% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9) + 3min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3) + 1min @ 84% FTP (Z3, RPE 5-6))
- 2 x (3min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3) + 1min @ 108% FTP (Z5+, RPE 8-9))
- 3min @ 65% FTP (Z2, RPE 3)
-Cadence: 85-100rpm (race-like cadence variation)
-Position: Standing attacks, drops between

COOL-DOWN:
-2min easy spin Z1-Z2

PROGRESSION:
-Level 3/6: Development - Standard training load, building consistency
-Three-hour race simulation. Nail the personalized race prescription throughout

EXECUTION:
-Ride the opening tempo under control, settle at threshold, make the final lift clean, then recover at the prescribed power.</description>
  <sportType>bike</sportType>
  <workout>
    <Warmup Duration="120" PowerLow="0.50" PowerHigh="0.70" />
    <SteadyState Duration="180" Power="0.65" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95" />
    <SteadyState Duration="60" Power="1.08" CadenceLow="85" CadenceHigh="95" />
